## Why Choose Qmax for PCB Design?

- **First-Time-Right Philosophy** — DRC, SI/PI, and thermal simulation before Gerbers leave the building; first fabricated board behaves as designed.
- **30,000+ Verified Component Libraries** — Every symbol, footprint, and 3D model validated against manufacturer datasheets.
- **Global Compliance Expertise** — CE, FCC, UL, IPC, and MIL-STD-461 designed in at the layout stage.
- **Production & Documentation Readiness** — 100% DFM-verified files to IPC-2221/2226; IPC-2581/ODB++ packages, controlled-impedance drill tables.
- **Fabrication Partner Network** — Qualified fabs and assembly houses with traceable sourcing; FR-4, Megtron 6, Rogers 4350B material lock-in.
- **Strict IP Protection** — Mutual NDA from day one; access-controlled vault; customers own all IP at every milestone.

